ce_cn":"混蛋，又来偷水管了？！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1220244004:1":{"key":"say:7:1220244004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1220244004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"就是你们害我的店老是断水？信不信老子送你们去喂鲨鱼！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1220244005:1":{"key":"say:8:1220244005:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1220244005","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"不就是断水吗？反正水又不好喝，根本没人喝水！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1220244006:1":{"key":"say:9:1220244006:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1220244006","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"反、反、反正喝酒，喝酒就行了！水……又贵，又，嗝，难喝！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:12:1220244007:1":{"key":"say:12:1220244007:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1220244007","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你这管子早就烂了，丢路边都没人要……我们拿去玩玩怎么了？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:13:1220244008:1":{"key":"say:13:1220244008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1220244008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"胡言乱语的混蛋，脑子都被酒泡坏了吧，你们知道在和谁说话吗？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:16:1220244009:1":{"key":"say:16:1220244009:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"16","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1220244009","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"这些家伙身上一股酒气，又在大白天喝酒了吧……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:17:1220244010:1":{"key":"say:17:1220244010:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"17","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1220244010","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"啊，我记得你们几个！怪模怪样的家伙和仓鼠！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:18:1220244011:1":{"key":"say:18:1220244011:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"18","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1220244011","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"上回看在沃尔特的面子上饶你们一回，怎么这次又带了个矮子来？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","docu